{
  "_comment": [
    "Where every hull's slots and cargo space sit on the ship designer's",
    "schematic. Read out of rghuldef (1008:29f0, 32 entries) and rghuldefSB",
    "(1008:4872, 5 entries): HULDEF.chs at +0x7A, HULDEF.wrcCargo at +0x7D and",
    "HULDEF.rgbrc[16] at +0x7F. A rgbrc byte is a cell on a 32-pixel grid --",
    "low nibble the column, high nibble the row -- and a slot is two cells",
    "square. wrcCargo packs two such bytes: the high byte is the cargo space's",
    "top-left cell, the low byte its bottom-right; ffff means the hull has no",
    "hold. See docs/ui/ship-design.md and UpdateSlotGlobals (10c8:6528)."
  ],
  "source": "rghuldef @ 1008:29f0 and rghuldefSB @ 1008:4872 in stars.2.7j.exe",
